// Bar = Minute
// First 15 bars - Predicion
// last 3 bars - Base
// last 5 bars - Last Base
// last 10 bars - Yesterday's Base
// last 20 bars - Fast Weekly Base
// last 50 bars - Slow Weekly Base
// last 100 bars - Monthly Base
// last 200 bars - Quarterly Base

// Bar = Hourly
// last bar - Predicion (Next Bar)
// last 3 bars - Base
// last 5 bars - Last Base
// last 10 bars - Yesterday's Base
